      "english": "“This is what ye shall say unto men, if ye make proclamation unto them in order that they may guard themselves from the doctrines of error. | Now, therefore, for the sake of sinners have I rent myself asunder and am come into the world, that I may save them. For even for the righteous, who have never done any evil and have not sinned at all,”",
